Inspired by Open Source Social Network (OSSN) — clean-room statement
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Some community features (groups with a join-request flow, post visibility
levels, reactions, notifications) were inspired by the *ideas and public
behaviour* of Open Source Social Network (https://github.com/opensource-socialnetwork).

  * No OSSN source code, SQL, templates, translations or assets are copied into
    this repository. OSSN is licensed under the Cryptographic Autonomy License
    1.0 (CAL-1.0), which is not compatible with the AGPL for combined works.
  * Contributors must not copy code from OSSN into The Fold, and must not port
    it line by line. Design from the behaviour, not from the source.
  * The schema in apps/community-api was designed independently (typed tables,
    tenant row-level security), not derived from OSSN's schema.

